new file mode 100644
index 000000000..514df65ab
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Commas inside a regular expression (in a ``{m,n}`` quantifier, a character class
+such as ``[,;]``, or escaped as ``\,``) no longer split it in options taking a
+comma-separated list of regular expressions, such as ``bad-names-rgxs``.
+
+Closes #7229
